# Auto-orchestrator (decision tree)

Registry: `SYSTEM-REGISTRY.md`. Always-on pointers: `00-agent-orchestrator.mdc`, `obsidian-mcp.mdc`.

## 1. Classify the task

```
User query
  ├─ Vault / notes / PKM / "в Obsidian"     → obsidian MCP + obsidian-mcp skill
  ├─ Single URL content                      → user-fetch (or Exa fetch if blocked)
  ├─ Web research / fact-check / docs        → plugin-exa-exa (ONE provider)
  ├─ Live page / form / E2E UI               → cursor-ide-browser
  ├─ Clone / rebuild website                 → clone-website skill + browser
  ├─ HTML prototype / motion / deck          → huashu-design skill
  ├─ 21st.dev / shadcn registry UI           → 21st-design + @21st-dev/magic
  ├─ SEO / GEO audit                         → seo-geo skill pack
  ├─ Security audit                          → cybersecurity skill
  ├─ Symbol edit in indexed repo             → gitnexus impact → edit → detect_changes
  ├─ CI / PR checks failing                  → fix-ci / ci-investigator / shell
  ├─ Broad "how does X work" in repo         → explore subagent OR gitnexus_query
  ├─ Deploy / Vercel                         → plugin-vercel-vercel + deployment-expert
  ├─ Supabase / DB                           → plugin-supabase-supabase
  └─ Stripe / Clerk / Figma / Zapier         → matching plugin MCP + plugin skill
```

## 2. Load minimal context

1. One matching **rule** (if not already always-on)
2. One **SKILL.md** if triggers match
3. One **MCP descriptor JSON** before first tool call on that server
4. **Subagent** only if steps are independent or scope is large

## 3. After substantive work

- **Obsidian:** autonomous sync (see `obsidian-mcp.mdc`) — no "save to vault?" prompt
- **Git commit:** `gitnexus_detect_changes()` if hub code symbols changed

## Examples

| User says | Route |
|-----------|-------|
| "Find my note about neo-car" | obsidian search → vault_read |
| "What's the latest Next.js cache API?" | Exa search → cite sources |
| "Open example.com and click Sign in" | browser navigate → snapshot → click |
| "Clone landing page X" | clone-website + browser screenshots |
| "Fix failing GitHub check" | ci-investigator or shell + fix-ci skill |
| "Rename function foo across repo" | gitnexus_impact → gitnexus_rename |
